# direnv reads this file. direnv is a program that loads a shell when a person
# enters a directory. This file tells direnv to load the shell of flake.nix.
#
# direnv loads the shell again after a change to flake.nix or to flake.lock.
# flake.nix reads the release of Rust from rust-toolchain.toml, so the first
# line below adds that file to the list.
watch_file rust-toolchain.toml
use flake
